    11	behaviour/risk flags are intentionally NOT auto-bound, preserving the
    12	default-blocked trading posture. Raw secret values are never logged.
    13	
    14	The bootstrap is best-effort: any failure is swallowed so a missing or
    15	malformed credential file can never break worker startup.
